<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Anaconda on 111qqz的小窝</title><link>https://111qqz.com/tags/anaconda/</link><description>Recent content in Anaconda on 111qqz的小窝</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><copyright>© 2015-2026 111qqz</copyright><lastBuildDate>Thu, 08 Jun 2017 13:03:51 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://111qqz.com/tags/anaconda/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>conda升级anaconda　ValueError的解决办法</title><link>https://111qqz.com/2017/06how-to-fix-conda-upgrade-valueerror/</link><pubDate>Thu, 08 Jun 2017 13:03:51 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://111qqz.com/2017/06how-to-fix-conda-upgrade-valueerror/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;conda update anaconda　后提示&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight-wrapper"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-asm" data-lang="asm"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="ln"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nl"&gt;ValueError:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;unsupported&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="no"&gt;format&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="no"&gt;character&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="err"&gt;&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;0x29&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="no"&gt;at&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="no"&gt;index&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;49&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;查到了这个：&lt;a href="https://github.com/conda/conda/issues/564" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"&gt;anaconda update issue&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;I have narrowed this down to the following packages:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table &gt;
&lt;tr &gt;
package
build
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tbody &gt;
&lt;tr &gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;td &gt;psutil-1.2.1
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;td &gt;py27_0 hard-link
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr &gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;td &gt;pycparser-2.10
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;td &gt;py27_0 hard-link
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr &gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;td &gt;pykit-0.1.0
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;td &gt;np18py27_2 hard-link
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr &gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;td &gt;pyparsing-2.0.1
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;td &gt;py27_0 hard-link
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
by calling "conda install anaconda" and then successfully installing everything else one at a time.
These four packages consistently exhibit the described behaviour.
(note: pykit depends on pycparser so may itself be ok - can't tell)
&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;我先把psutil卸载掉，重新update了一下，成功。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>